  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Ahh... What a nostalgic feeling!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Amiya, was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Ah, ahaha! I see... So that's what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I remember now, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I've already gotten what I came for. You can all go now. Shoo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "You...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "W...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "... What, do you lot want to stay here and die? That's perfectly fine by me. You're all free to do as you please."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "We're falling back. Let them go. Talulah's orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Forget it. Things get boring when they get dragged out too long. I hate being bored, that's all there is to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "However, I do look forward to seeing you again, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "As well as... that person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What...? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Next time, I will hear the truth from you, {@Nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Bye~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What... Why... is she doing this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Reunion... they've left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "--We've long missed the rendezvous time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Retreat back to Rhodes Island... immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'll escort... the Operators in the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "... All right.."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Go, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "... ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "... Boss...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Where are the others..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Nearl and the others have already broken out with Amiya and Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Those who stayed behind..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "... They're all gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "... What..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "We're the only two left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "I remember now... That, that freak... Talulah... single-handedly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "She knocked away our Guards like they were toy bricks..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "That monster cut through our Defenders as if they were butter..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Hush... Your wounds are deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "The Catastrophe...! She is Catastrophe incarnate... How, how else could she have reduced our squads to ashes in an instant..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Even though I saw it with my own eyes, I can't... I can't believe it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "The screams... Aagh... Gaaaah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Snap out of it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "I'm so sorry... I, I don't know how..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Calm down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "I gave you some emergency treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "... Boss... what happened to your arm...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "At least I still have one I can use."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Boss... You should go. I'm sure you'll be able to break your way out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "We only managed to stall her for a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Until Dr. {@nickname} and Amiya are safe, I cannot go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "I have to stop that monster first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Boss... I also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "The price of your life... was paid with my arm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "If you can live even a single minute longer, it will be worth it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "I'll be right back. Take care of yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Boss... I'm sorry... that I'm so unworthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "I'm sure you'll be able to... make everyone's dreams..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're all... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "... ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "... Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "... ... Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Oh, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "N-nothing... I just suddenly felt..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Grief..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "*sniff*... Urk..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Grief... huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Aauugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "... Don't cry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "At least... for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Someone once said to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Tears... should be saved for when the war is over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Now... is not the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Nnh... Ugh... Nn..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Let's go..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...We're going home."
    },
    {
